          %p Every coherent inverse function is a quasi-inverse function by forgetting the additional coherence condition.
          %p
          .num_theorem
            %h6 Theorem
            %p
              If a function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
